{"id":1647066901345190792,"title":"The Promised Neverland","title_alt":"Обещанный Неверленд - أرض الأحلام الموعودة - 約束のネバーランド - 约定的梦幻岛 - 약속의 네버랜드 - Обіцяний Неверленд - Yakusoku no Neverland - A Terra do Nunca Prometido - The Promised Neverland - Miền đất hứa - Vadedilmiş Yokyer - Yakusoku no Nebaarando - YnN - Обещанная Страна Грёз - Якусоку но Нэба:рандо - ناکجا آباد موعود - نيفيرلاند الموعودة - ","url":"00-yakusoku-no-neverland","public_url":"https:\/\/comick.io\/comic\/00-yakusoku-no-neverland","author":"Demizu Posuka","cover":"https:\/\/meo.comick.pictures\/3KNzZQ-s.jpg","description":"<p>At Grace Field House, life couldn't be better for the orphans! Though they have no parents, together with the other kids and a kind \"Mama\" who cares for them, they form one big, happy family. No child is ever overlooked, especially since they are all adopted by the age of 12. Their daily lives involve rigorous tests, but afterwards, they are allowed to play outside.<\/p>\n<p>There is only one rule they must obey: do not leave the orphanage. But one day, two top-scoring orphans, Emma and Norman, venture past the gate and unearth the horrifying reality behind their entire existence: they are all livestock, and their orphanage is a farm to cultivate food for a mysterious race of demons. With only a few months left to pull off an escape plan, the children must somehow change their predetermined fate.<\/p>\n<hr>\n<p>Official Release:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Indonesian release by Elex Media as <strong>The Promised Neverland<\/strong> (2019)<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n","rating":0.84300005,"nsfw":true,"state":"FINISHED","source":"COMICK_FUN","tags":[{"key":"gore","title":"Gore"},{"key":"drama","title":"Drama"},{"key":"demons","title":"Demons"},{"key":"supernatural","title":"Supernatural"},{"key":"award-winning","title":"Award Winning"},{"key":"thriller","title":"Thriller"},{"key":"survival","title":"Survival"},{"key":"tragedy","title":"Tragedy"},{"key":"slice-of-life","title":"Slice of Life"},{"key":